      <data key="d1">faculty</data>
      <data key="d2">Mechanico-Mathematical Faculty (MМФ) offers education in mathematics, applied mathematics, informatics, mechanics, and mathematical modeling. It participates in the "Engineering School: Artificial Intelligence and Applied Engineering" program and connects with research institutes located in Akademgorodok.&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanico-Mathematical Faculty is one of the main academic units within Novosibirsk State University.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-681b87b5ddf40fbbc0a67227a216a8c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3d6a8b784f4b3587c2e289eeda2d55e</data>
